        dat('the readback row 12:31 — VARIANT by kind (abomination_barred Deut 7:25) with the pair 12:4 / 12:31 a DATA row; the exam\'s person the one who offers to an idol what the Temple does not offer — not liable by the rite\'s key (81:5): accepted')
