        move('the Sifrei 81:6 (read whole at the reading); Sanhedrin 74b:1, 74b:5-7, 74b:9 (read whole at the docket)', "'EVEN THEIR SONS AND THEIR DAUGHTERS' — 'even' includes THEIR FATHERS AND MOTHERS (81:6 — R. Akiva: I saw a gentile who bound his father before his dog, and it ate him); the children in the fire the Molech's kin (the next row — no Molech named); THE PERSECUTION'S EDGES — the three for which one dies rather than transgresses: idolatry, incest and bloodshed (Sanhedrin 74b:1); in public and in private, in a time of persecution (74b:5-7); THE LIMB OF A LIVING ANIMAL among the seven Noahide laws (74b:9 — 12:23's limb the kin)")
