def the_readback(case, data):
    """THE TABLE — THE READBACK (THE LOOP's step 6 — the forms on file, no new form): the table's census; the state row (T5 — 12:9 SUPPLIED with no write); the pointer row (12:20); the supplied law rows (12:4, 12:7, 12:17, 12:19, 12:30 — SUPPLIED WITH THEIR WRITES, the code's holes); no retrograde row (no act told only here — measured)"""
